<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115866" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύρα</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῠ]</span>, τά, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>Psyra,</i> a
			barren islet near Chios, taken as the type of what is insignificant:
			prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ψύρα τὸν Διόνυσον
			ἄγοντες</span> (<i>saying 'a fig for Dionysus!'</i>), of
			persons who drink no wine, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				352
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ψύρα τε τὴν Σπάρτην ἄγεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					112
				</span></i>
			; also called <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῠρίη</span></b> ,
				ἡ, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.171
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψύριος:</span></b> 
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκάθαρτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψῠρὶς</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ</span>
			<i>barren</i> land, like that of Psyra, Id.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
